name: Throwback — skipped-blind mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Throwback gains X0.25 Mult for each Blind skipped this run. First-shop scaling: skip
  Small/Blinds to build X-mult; pair with Hologram (deck grows) and boss-kill tools.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Throwback
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Hologram
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Rocket
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
